<h2>
"Quote"
</h2>
<blockquote>
<p>
"A quoted paragraph with"
<em>
"markup"
</em>
"."
</p>
<p>
"And a second paragraph."
</p>
</blockquote>
<h2>
"Center"
</h2>
<p>
"Centred text."
</p>
<h2>
"Example"
</h2>
<pre>
"Verbatim *not bold* text. Indentation preserved."
</pre>
<h2>
"Export"
</h2>
<aside>
"Raw HTML passes through."
</aside>
<h2>
"Source"
</h2>
<pre>
<code>
"def greet(name): return f\"hello {name}\""
</code>
</pre>
<pre>
<code>
"plain block, no language"
</code>
</pre>
<h2>
"Nested"
</h2>
<blockquote>
<p>
"A quote containing a source block:"
</p>
<pre>
<code>
"echo hi"
</code>
</pre>
</blockquote>
<h2>
"Verse"
</h2>
<p>
"Line breaks are the point"
<br>
"and indentation survives."
</p>
<h2>
"A named special block"
</h2>
<p>
"Contents are"
<strong>
"org"
</strong>
", not literal text."
</p>
